# Mobile-friendly UI

Ship a usable first view at 320px width. Enhance at 640px and 900px.

## Required

- Viewport is already in HTML; do not disable zoom (`user-scalable=no`)
- One column below 900px; no horizontal scroll
- Tap targets at least 44×44px (nav links included)
- Sticky header must not cover headings; test skip-link + first `h1`
- Images `max-width: 100%`; prefer `aspect-ratio` to avoid layout shift
- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`

```css
/* ❌ BAD */
.nav a { padding: 0.2rem; font-size: 0.7rem; }

/* ✅ GOOD */
.nav a { min-height: 44px; padding: 0.7rem 0.9rem; }
```

## Do not

- Use hover-only actions for primary navigation or CTAs
- Set `min-width` on layouts above the viewport
- Add a hamburger unless the three-link nav no longer fits
